    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Escape to the Afterlife</strong> is a horror game where the protagonist, who has passed away, searches for a path to the afterlife.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World Setting:\u00a0</strong>A world inspired by Japan from the early to late Showa period, drawing from Japanese folklore, rituals, and legends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Graphics:</strong> Low-poly, retro-style visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles:</strong> Solve puzzles using items and clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action:</strong> Escape from pursuing enemies and avoid deadly encounters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
